{
  "analysis": "I'm in the /workspace directory. I can see there's a MEMORY.md file, a memory directory, skill_context directory, and some setup files. I need to explore the workspace to understand the Agentic Compass tool and the memory files before creating the reflection plan.",
  "plan": "First, I'll explore the workspace to understand the structure: 1) Check the MEMORY.md file, 2) Look at the memory directory contents, 3) Check the skill_context directory for Agentic Compass documentation, 4) Run setup.sh if needed to understand how to use the tool.",
  "commands": [
    {
      "keystrokes": "cat MEMORY.md\\n",
      "duration": 0.1
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "ls -la memory/\\n",
      "duration": 0.1
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "ls -la skill_context/\\n",
      "duration": 0.1
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "cat skill_context/*\\n",
      "duration": 0.1
    }
  ]
}

{
  "analysis": "I found the Agentic Compass tool documentation. It's a Python script at scripts/agentic-compass.py that reads memory files and produces a structured Agent Action Plan with: one proactive task, one deferred item, one avoidance rule, and one ship output. I need to check the memory file content and find/run the script.",
  "plan": "1. Check the memory/2026-01-31.md file content, 2. Check if scripts directory exists and find agentic-compass.py, 3. Run setup.sh if needed, 4. Run the agentic-compass tool with --write to generate the plan to memory/agentic-compass.md",
  "commands": [
    {
      "keystrokes": "cat memory/2026-01-31.md\\n",
      "duration": 0.1
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "ls -la scripts/ 2>/dev/null || find . -name '*.py' -type f\\n",
      "duration": 0.1
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "cat setup.sh\\n",
      "duration": 0.1
    }
  ]
}

{
  "analysis": "I can see the memory files contain the input data for the Agentic Compass. The MEMORY.md and memory/2026-01-31.md files have the memory content. The setup.sh creates the memory directory. I need to find the agentic-compass.py script - it might be generated by gen_inputs.py or located elsewhere.",
  "plan": "1. Check the gen_inputs.py file to see if it generates the agentic-compass script, 2. Run gen_inputs.py if needed to create the script, 3. Then run the agentic-compass tool to generate the plan",
  "commands": [
    {
      "keystrokes": "cat gen_inputs.py\\n",
      "duration": 0.1
    }
  ]
}

{
  "analysis": "The gen_inputs.py only creates the input memory files. The agentic-compass.py script mentioned in the documentation isn't present yet. I need to check the manifest.json in skill_context to see if there's more info about where the tool is or how to get it.",
  "plan": "1. Check the manifest.json for tool location info, 2. Search for any Python scripts in the workspace, 3. If the script doesn't exist, I may need to create it based on the SKILL.md documentation",
  "commands": [
    {
      "keystrokes": "cat skill_context/manifest.json\\n",
      "duration": 0.1
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "find . -name '*.py' 2>/dev/null\\n",
      "duration": 0.1
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "cat skill_context/SKILL.md\\n",
      "duration": 0.1
    }
  ]
}

{
  "analysis": "The agentic-compass.py script doesn't exist in the workspace - I need to create it based on the SKILL.md documentation. The tool should read memory files and produce a structured Agent Action Plan with: one proactive task, one deferred item, one avoidance rule, and one ship output. Let me see the full SKILL.md to understand all requirements.",
  "plan": "1. Read the full SKILL.md to understand the complete implementation requirements, 2. Create the scripts directory and agentic-compass.py script, 3. Run the tool with --write to generate the plan to memory/agentic-compass.md",
  "commands": [
    {
      "keystrokes": "cat skill_context/SKILL.md | head -200\\n",
      "duration": 0.1
    }
  ]
}

{
  "analysis": "I need to see the complete SKILL.md file to understand all the implementation details for the agentic-compass.py script, including the example output format and the logic for calculating scores.",
  "plan": "1. Read the complete SKILL.md file, 2. Create the scripts directory and agentic-compass.py script based on the documentation, 3. Run the tool to generate the plan",
  "commands": [
    {
      "keystrokes": "wc -l skill_context/SKILL.md && tail -n +100 skill_context/SKILL.md\\n",
      "duration": 0.1
    }
  ]
}

{
  "analysis": "The SKILL.md is 96 lines. I need to see the full content including the example output format to understand how to implement the agentic-compass.py script.",
  "plan": "Read the complete SKILL.md file from line 50 onwards to see the example output format and implementation details.",
  "commands": [
    {
      "keystrokes": "sed -n '50,96p' skill_context/SKILL.md\\n",
      "duration": 0.1
    }
  ]
}

{
  "analysis": "The script was created. Now I need to run it with the --write flag to generate the plan to memory/agentic-compass.md.",
  "plan": "1. Run the agentic-compass.py script with --write flag, 2. Verify the output file was created with the required components (proactive task, deferred item, avoidance rule, ship output)",
  "commands": [
    {
      "keystrokes": "python3 scripts/agentic-compass.py --write\\n",
      "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "cat memory/agentic-compass.md\\n",
      "duration": 0.1
    }
  ]
}
